  "body": "## What changed\n\nCutter compensation gains a **Wear** mode next to Control and Off.\n\n- Wear walks the same tool-centre path as Control (same mid-run seam and leads). The post writes those centre moves unchanged under G41/G42 Dn / G40, so the D register holds only the wear delta.\n- It keeps every Control refusal, worded \"wear compensation …\": straight leads ≥ a tool radius, tabs, corner blends, overlap, keep-down links, open contours and runs, and 3+2 tilt. It skips Control's full-radius room check at inside corners and necks, which doesn't apply.\n- Stream: `COMP LEFT|RIGHT <µm> WEAR`, and any other word after the radius is refused. Scripts get `CompensationType` (\"wear\" or \"control\").\n- Fanuc writes the same G41/G42 Dn / G40, plus one comment per section: `(WEAR COMP - D01 HOLDS THE WEAR DELTA ONLY, NOT THE TOOL RADIUS)`. Haas, Mazak, Sinumerik, Heidenhain and the lathe post refuse compensation by name, and the gate blocks them.\n- Project file: `wear_comp` and the span's `wear` flag are written only when on, so earlier files and goldens are unchanged.\n- UI: the Compensation dropdown gains \"Wear (G41/G42)\" with a D-register reminder, via `EditOperationParams`.\n- Docs: RECOMMENDED.md, docs/CNC-INTERMEDIATE.md and assets/posts/AGENTS.md.\n\n## Pins\n\n- Golden `tests/golden/nc/contour_wear_comp.nc` (Fanuc, a 10×10 box with a 6 mm end mill on the tool-centre ring): `G01 G42 X13 Y5 … D01` … `G01 G40 X13 Y11 …`\n- app `wear_comp` (4): golden plus gate, other posts refuse, undo/redo, round-trip\n- motion `wear_comp` (2): the programmed moves are the centre moves; refusals carry the wear name\n- post `comp` round-trip and malformed-record cases\n\n## Readings\n\napp conformance 6, control_comp 4, fanuc_post 8, golden_cl 23, posting 17, wear_comp 4, project_roundtrip 68; motion control_comp 8, wear_comp 2; post and cl tests; clippy on cl, motion, post, app and ui is clean.\n\nChangelog: Cutter compensation gains a Wear mode: the contour's tool-centre path is posted under G41/G42 Dn / G40 with the register holding only the wear delta (Fanuc; other posts refuse by name)\n\nFixes #38\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
